# Composite figures

A composite figure typesets as one numbered unit: the panels keep their own
captions, the group caption closes the figure, and only the group takes a
list-of-figures entry.

{#fig-mixed .columns-2}
::: figure
| Kind | N |
|------|---|
| a    | 1 |
